 "stimulus_html": "You have a modified deck of cards containing only 3<span data-math=\"\\heartsuit\"></span>, 4<span data-math=\"\\heartsuit\"></span>, and 5<span data-math=\"\\heartsuit\"></span>. You draw 2 two cards without replacing them (where order matters). What is the probability of each event?",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 515843,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The first card drawn is 3<span data-math=\"\\heartsuit\"></span>.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The “tree” as a table: These are all hearts, so only the number of the card is in the table.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Root</td>\n<td>1<sup>st</sup> Draw</td>\n<td>2<sup>nd</sup> Draw</td>\n<td>Results</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>34</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>35</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>43</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>45</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>53</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>54</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>There are six possible results.</p>\n<p><i>P</i>(the first card is a 3 heart) = <span data-math=\"\\frac{2}{6} = \\frac{1}{3}\"></span>.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"\\frac{1}{3}\">\\frac{1}{3}</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
