    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The “tree” as a table: These are all hearts, so only the number of the card is in the table.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Root</td>\n<td>1<sup>st</sup> Draw</td>\n<td>2<sup>nd</sup> Draw</td>\n<td>Results</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>34</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>35</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>43</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>45</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>53</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>54</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>There are six possible results. The ones that satisfy the requirement are 34, 35, and 45.</p>\n<p><i>P</i>(the first card drawn has a lower number than the second card) <span data-math=\" = \\frac{3}{6} = \\frac{1}{2}\"></span>.</p>\n"
    },
    {
